value": "2009", "formInput": "electricity%20%22section%20127%22%20appeal%20pre-deposit%20%20doctypes%3A%20highcourts+year:2009"}, {"value": "2013", "formInput": "electricity%20%22section%20127%22%20appeal%20pre-deposit%20%20doctypes%3A%20highcourts+year:2013"}, {"value": "2015", "formInput": "electricity%20%22section%20127%22%20appeal%20pre-deposit%20%20doctypes%3A%20highcourts+year:2015"}]]], "docs": [{"tid": 68250606, "catids": null, "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2014-02-11", "authorid": 1190, "bench": [1190], "title": "Sukumaran C.E vs Kerala Stateelectricity Board on 11 February, 2014", "numcites": 1, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>appeal</b>.             The <b>appeal</b> is\n\naccompanied by Ext.P13 petition to waive the <b>pre</b>-<b>deposit</b>. There\n\nis no provision to waive the <b>pre</b>-<b>deposit</b> ... petitioner is obliged to <b>deposit</b> one half of the\n\namount assessed under  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>(2)  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act,\n\n2003.\n \n       2.   The petitioner asserts that", "docsize": 6188, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court", "author": "V Chitambaresh", "authorEncoded": "v-chitambaresh"}, {"tid": 28131329, "catids": [698, 525], "doctype": 1023, "publishdate": "2014-07-07", "authorid": 1518, "bench": [1518], "title": "Dr. Satyendra Kumar vs The Bihar State <b>Electricity</b> Board & Ors. on 7 July, 2014", "numcites": 1, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>appeal</b> and in which connection he tried to\n\n                 <b>deposit</b> 50% of the bill which is a condition precedent for filing an\n\n                 <b>appeal</b> under <b>Section</b> <b>127</b> ... proviso to <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>(1) is 30 days and which had\n\n                 expired hence the <b>deposit</b> as required under <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>(2) was\n\n                 not accepted", "docsize": 4773, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Patna High Court - Orders", "author": "J Saran", "authorEncoded": "j-saran"}, {"tid": 22163141, "catids": null, "doctype": 1024, "publishdate": "2012-11-08", "authorid": 1612, "bench": [1612], "title": "Taranjit Singh vs The Commissioner on 8 November, 2012", "numcites": 2, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>pre</b>-\ncondition of <b>depositing</b> 50% of the liability assessed, for entertaining the\nappellant&#x27;s statutory <b>appeal</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> ... already been <b>deposited</b> by the appellant and he is still to <b>deposit</b>\nRs.11,00,000/- more to meet the 50% <b>pre</b>-<b>deposit</b> condition", "docsize": 5008, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Punjab-Haryana High Court", "author": "S Kant", "authorEncoded": "s-kant"}, {"tid": 182987245, "catids": null, "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2014-10-17", "authorid": 1165, "bench": [1165], "title": "Senny Johnson A.J vs Assistant Engineer on 17 October, 2014", "numcites": 1, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "order permitting the\n\n            Petitioner to file <b>Appeal</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>  of\n\n            the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003 without <b>depositing</b>\n\n            half of the amount of the Penal Bill ... <b>section</b> <b>127</b>  of the Act. The petitioner, however,\n\nseeks to issue a direction to permit the petitioner to pursue the\n\n<b>appeal</b> without effecting the <b>pre</b>", "docsize": 5411, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court", "author": "P R Menon", "authorEncoded": "p-r-menon"}, {"tid": 129121432, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2024-05-30", "authorid": 227, "bench": [227], "title": "Arun Kumar Tiwari vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Energy ... on 30 May, 2024", "numcites": 2, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "under  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, the petitioner can file <b>Appeal</b> against the final assessment order. The petitioner has not preferred any <b>Appeal</b> ... petitioner has not approached the appropriate authority in <b>Appeal</b> because there is a condition of <b>pre</b>-<b>deposit</b> of 50% of the assessment order", "docsize": 3302, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "S Chandra", "authorEncoded": "s-chandra"}, {"tid": 172959081, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2024-04-30", "authorid": 132, "bench": [132], "title": "Israr Ahmad vs Purvanchal Vidyut Vitran Nigam Ltd And ... on 30 April, 2024", "numcites": 1, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "counsel for the respondent-<b>Electricity</b> Department submits that the petitioner has remedy of filing <b>appeal</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> ... petitioner will file <b>appeal</b> within two weeks and the Appellate Authority may be directed to consider and decide the <b>appeal</b> subject to the petitioner complying", "docsize": 3075, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "M K Gupta", "authorEncoded": "m-k-gupta"}, {"tid": 152539030, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2024-05-02", "authorid": 132, "bench": [132], "title": "M/S Aradhya Foods vs State Of Up And 2 Others on 2 May, 2024", "numcites": 2, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "decision taken by the respondent-<b>Electricity</b> Department on 29.02.2024 making final assessment in a case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. The decision has been taken ... appearing for respondent-<b>Electricity</b> Department submits that the petitioners have alternative remedy of filing <b>appeal</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b>", "docsize": 2456, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "M K Gupta", "authorEncoded": "m-k-gupta"}, {"tid": 194618823, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2025-09-04", "authorid": null, "bench": null, "title": "Jagmohan Singh vs State Of U.P. And 4 Others on 4 September, 2025", "numcites": 2, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "efficacious remedy is available by way of an <b>appeal</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003, the present writ petiton is not maintainable before ... file the <b>appeal</b> within a period of two weeks from date. In the event such an <b>appeal</b> is filed along with <b>pre</b>-<b>deposit</b> within", "docsize": 2345, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 148080204, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2022-11-03", "authorid": null, "bench": [277, 308], "title": "Bali Gupta @ Baliram Gupta vs State Of U.P. And 4 Others on 3 November, 2022", "numcites": 1, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "remedy before the petitioner is to file <b>appeal</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003.\n  \n At this stage, learned counsel for the petitioner submits ... file <b>appeal</b> before the competent authority.\n  \n However, in case, the petitioner files such an <b>appeal</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003 within", "docsize": 3135, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 128308495, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2022-11-15", "authorid": null, "bench": [277, 308], "title": "Mubarak Ahmad vs State Of U.P. And 3 Othrs on 15 November, 2022", "numcites": 1, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "authority by invoking provision of  <b>Section</b> <b>127</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act&#x27; 2003. \n  \n In case, the petitioner files an <b>appeal</b> alongwith the copy of this ... decide the <b>appeal</b> on merits without raising any objection as to the limitation in filing thereof. \n  \n However, the requirement of <b>pre</b>-<b>deposit</b> to maintain", "docsize": 2437, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}], "found": "61 - 70 of 116", "encodedformInput": "electricity%20%22section%20127%22%20appeal%20pre-deposit%20doctypes%3Ahighcourts"}